{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Route: Kyiv \u2014 Myrhorod</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience one of Ukraine\u2019s busiest and most scenic mainlines in ZDSimulator. The <strong>Kyiv \u2013 Myrhorod</strong> route spans approximately 250 km of electrified railway, forming part of the vital east-west corridor connecting the capital with Kharkiv.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\ude84 <strong>What to Expect:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Realistic infrastructure of a key Ukrainian railway artery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Detailed stations including Kyiv-Pasazhyrskyi, Darnytsia, Yahotyn, Hrebinka, Lubny, and Myrhorod</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic traffic: Intercity+, long-distance, suburban, and freight trains</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">High-speed operation with strict timetable adherence</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A variety of locomotives \u2014 from classic electrics to modern express units</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf24\ufe0f <strong>Atmosphere of the Journey:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Begin your shift at the bustling <strong>Kyiv Central Station</strong>, cross the Dnipro River through the urban expanse of the capital, and power through the heart of Ukraine\u2019s countryside \u2014 forests, rivers, and wide-open fields \u2014 before arriving at the tranquil resort town of <strong>Myrhorod</strong>, nestled along the Poltava line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udee4\ufe0f <strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Double-track mainline with AC electrification</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Authentic signaling and speed restrictions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Event scripting, dynamic weather changes, realistic AI traffic</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This route is perfect for both newcomers and experienced drivers looking for a blend of high-speed operations and classic passenger service. Tight schedules, changing traffic patterns, and detailed scenery guarantee an immersive driving experience.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3614910?t=1744918011","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614910/f2d573c7abbd4eaa9385e19ba6c941d53d29c94c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744918011","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614910/0b114292d36d9c4e2b673e7a3531039cbb21aa65/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744918011","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614910/0b114292d36d9c4e2b673e7a3531039cbb21aa65/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744918011","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Route: Kyiv \u2014 Myrhorod</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience one of Ukraine\u2019s busiest and most scenic mainlines in ZDSimulator. The <strong>Kyiv \u2013 Myrhorod</strong> route spans approximately 250 km of electrified railway, forming part of the vital east-west corridor connecting the capital with Kharkiv.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\ude84 <strong>What to Expect:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Realistic infrastructure of a key Ukrainian railway artery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Detailed stations including Kyiv-Pasazhyrskyi, Darnytsia, Yahotyn, Hrebinka, Lubny, and Myrhorod</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic traffic: Intercity+, long-distance, suburban, and freight trains</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">High-speed operation with strict timetable adherence</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A variety of locomotives \u2014 from classic electr